        "date_posted": "2026-10-22T00:00:00+00:00",
        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "**About the Role**\n\nWe are looking for a Junior AI Native Full Stack Developer who is passionate about modern software development and already uses AI coding tools in their daily workflow. You should be able to build complete features from backend to frontend while continuously learning and improving your technical skills.\n\n**Key Responsibilities**\n\n* Develop and maintain full\\-stack web applications.\n* Build features from the database to the user interface.\n* Use AI coding assistants to improve development efficiency.\n* Review and improve AI\\-generated code before implementation.\n* Develop and consume REST APIs.\n* Write unit, integration, and end\\-to\\-end tests.\n* Work with cloud technologies and deployment tools.\n* Collaborate with international teams across different time zones.\n\n**Requirements**\n\n* 1–3 years of software engineering experience (internships and strong personal projects will also be considered).\n* Experience with Node.js (TypeScript), Python, or Go.\n* Experience with React, Next.js, or a similar frontend framework.\n* Ability to build complete full\\-stack features independently.\n* Practical experience using AI coding tools such as Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Cursor, or similar.\n* Ability to review and improve AI\\-generated code.\n* Working knowledge of unit, integration, and end\\-to\\-end testing.\n* Basic knowledge of cloud platforms, containers, managed databases, or serverless services.\n* Good communication skills and willingness to work with international teams.\n\n**Preferred**\n\n* Exposure to MCP, LLM orchestration, Agent SDKs, APIs, Webhooks, CRM integrations, or automation workflows.\n* Participation in hackathons, open\\-source projects, or personal portfolio projects.\n\nWork Location: In person",
