    "linkedin:fc9824252072fa633065552f": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Software Engineer Intern",
        "company": "AyyatSoft",
        "location": "Lahore, Punjab, Pakistan",
        "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4480025517",
        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "🚀\n **WE’RE HIRING: Software Engineer Intern** \n\n\n\n\n**AYYATSOFT \\| AI • Software • Product Engineering** \n\n\n\n\n Want to gain practical experience building real software products? AYYATSOFT is looking for a motivated\n **Software Engineer Intern** \n who is eager to learn, solve problems, and grow as a developer.\n \n\n\n\n**📌 Internship Details** \n\n\n\n* **Position:** \n Software Engineer Intern\n* **Duration:** \n 3 months\n* **Work Mode:** \n Remote\n* **Compensation:** \n Unpaid internship\n* **Company:** \n AYYATSOFT\n\n\n\n**What You’ll Do** \n\n\n\n* Assist in developing and improving web applications and software products.\n* Work with frontend and backend technologies.\n* Help integrate APIs and work with databases.\n* Debug issues, test features, and improve application quality.\n* Collaborate on practical software engineering tasks.\n* Learn about Git, code reviews, debugging, and development workflows.\n\n\n\n**Who Should Apply?** \n\n\n\n* Students, recent graduates, or aspiring software engineers.\n* Basic knowledge of JavaScript and web development.\n* Familiarity with React, Next.js, Node.js, Angular, PHP, or databases is a plus.\n* Basic understanding of Git and APIs.\n* A willingness to learn, accept feedback, and solve problems.\n\n\n\n**What You’ll Gain** \n\n\n\n* Hands\\-on experience with software development workflows.\n* Mentorship and practical learning opportunities.\n* Experience working on software products and business solutions.\n* An internship completion certificate, subject to successful completion of the program.\n\n\n\n 📩\n **Interested?** \n Send your CV and GitHub profile on Email\n **careers@ayyatsoft.com** \n or portfolio through\n **Link** \n https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScPC\\-83rIf\\-qEH3OODB4lrGN\\-8yhf44itYyJa6WBJK3oXgb5g/viewform?usp\\=dialog.\n \n\n\n\n Please mention\n **“Software Engineer Intern”** \n in your message.\n \n\n\n\n \\#Hiring \\#SoftwareEngineer \\#SoftwareDevelopment \\#TechInternship \\#RemoteInternship \\#AYYATSOFT",
